}, {"contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Organize the mystery sentence. Move each word to place it in the correct order. \n", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "id": 8, "type": "WSB"}, {"questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "even more dance classes after tonight.", "type": "text"}], "id": 1}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I want to take", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}], "id": 0}, {"responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "now my new hobby.", "type": "text"}], "id": 1}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Ballroom dancing is", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}], "id": 1}, {"responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "to any other classes.", "type": "text"}], "id": 1}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I don't need to go", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}], "id": 2}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " \nSachi really enjoyed her dance lesson.\n", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Move the words up or down <span class=\"sena-icon sena-icon-vertical-drag\"></span> to complete each sentence.\n", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "id": 9, "type": "MT1"}, {"questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 1}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"contents": [], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "id": 10, "type": "RSLT"}, {"questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "engenn8le05ob11re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Organize a dance party.", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "id": 11, "type": "DWS"}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le05ob11re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le05ob11re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le05ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le05ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tDid you have a good weekend, Jose?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tI did, thank you. It was very cold, but I had fun. It was a shock the first couple of weeks, but I can get by with my coat now.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tGoing out when it's freezing outside is something you're supposed to enjoy here! Personally, I prefer to lie down the beach. Anyway, what did you do?"}, {"time": "20000", "image": "engenn8le05ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tI went ice skating, and I made a new friend. He's a Colombian student as well, so I told him that he was supposed to keep at it and try to talk to people as much as possible.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tThat's great! You guys can hang out whenever you feel homesick. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tYes. That should make up for missing all my friends back home. It's nice to dress up and go dancing, too.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tMaybe the two of you should teach us some moves. We could turn the dining area into a dance floor after closing time.\t<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tThat would be great. I look forward to teaching all of you. We love sharing our passion for dancing."}, {"time": "54500", "image": "engenn8le05ob11re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tYou should be prepared to put up with some slow learners. Bruce and I aren't very good dancers!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tThat's not a problem. It's supposed to be a fun activity. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tLet's give it a try. I need to find more ways to let my hair down a bit.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tYour hair looks fine like that.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tThat's an expression, Jose ... It means having fun."}]}}], "id": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "The New Waiter", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A New Friend", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 5, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Accurately use information about people's backgrounds in a wider variety  of communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Inseparable Phrasal Verbs", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " Phrasal verbs consist of a verb and one or more prepositions. They are common, especially in informal spoken English. The meaning of phrasal verbs is often completely different from the meaning of the verb alone.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Separable phrasal verbs consist of two parts. They always require an object.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Inseparable phrasal verbs are very common. The verb must be directly followed by its preposition or adverb. Otherwise, the meaning of the phrasal verb will be incorrect.<br/>Some inseparable phrasal verbs never use an object.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Examples: <ul><li>get up = get out of bed<br/>    <span class=\"italic\">I get up at seven o'clock every morning.</span></li> <li>take off = leave the ground  <br/>         The plane took off on time.</span></li> <li>look out = beware! be careful!   <br/> <span class=\"italic\">Look out! That car is going to hit you!</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use the following inseparable phrasal verbs to describe life experiences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Phrasal Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to keep at\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to continue doing something\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to make up for\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to compensate for something missing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to put up with\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to tolerate\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to dress up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to wear elegant clothes\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to get by with\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to manage with little effort\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to look forward to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to eagerly anticipate something\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I had a shock the first couple of weeks, but I can get by with my coat now.", "type": "example"}, {"content": " It's nice to dress up and go dancing, too.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Verb + -ing and to + verb", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "A gerund is a noun made by adding \"-ing to the base form of a verb.\" You can use a gerund as the subject, the complement, or the object of a sentence.<br/>The infinitive is the base form of a verb - \u201cto + verb\u201d.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "A gerund is the -ing form of a verb that acts as a noun. The noun refers to an activity instead of a person or thing.You can use a gerund as the subject, the complement, or the object of a sentence.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Examples:<br/><br/>  Subject of sentence:<br/> <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Going</span> out when it's freezing outside is something you're supposed to enjoy here!</span><br/><br/>  Object of sentence:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">We love <span class=\"strong\">sharing</span> our passion for dancing.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "An infinitive is a verb form that can acts as a noun. It is formed with to + base form of the verb. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <span class=\"italic\">to talk</span>, <span class=\"italic\">to enjoy</span>, <span class=\"italic\">to play</span><br/> You can<span class=\"italic\">not</span> add <span class=\"strong\">s</span>, <span class=\"strong\">es</span>, <span class=\"strong\">ed</span>, or <span class=\"strong\">ing</span> to the end. It is not a verb.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">I need <span class=\"strong\">to find</span>  more ways <span class=\"strong\">to let</span> my hair down a bit.<br/>I prefer <span class=\"strong\">to lie</span> down on the beach.</span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to keep at", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to continue doing something; to persevere", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: You need to understand how the kitchen works before you start working. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: I'll keep at it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are the words to review.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to make up for", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to take care of something lost or missed", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Our summers make up for the cold winters.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to put up with ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to tolerate", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You have to put up with difficult customers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to dress up", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to wear elegant clothes", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: People like to dress up on Saturday nights.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to get by with", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to get by with little effort", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I think you can get by with what you know at this point.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to look forward to ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to eagerly anticipate something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm looking forward to the weekend.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "In pairs, brainstorm what your favorite types of parties are. Why do you like them?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Organize a dance party with your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "What is a good dance party supposed to have? What things are the hosts supposed to do? What things should you buy for a successful party?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a list of items you need to buy and do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present your party to the rest of the class.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The class will vote for the best idea.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I  talk about life experiences. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about things that I'm supposed to do and things that are  supposed to happen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about my attitudes toward an action.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I present my ideas in an organized and interesting manner.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}